Z||000004||Cliff Pennock||11-15-2000||01:59 PM||||I think you both posted an image once with invalid characters in the filename. Best thing to do is uninstall PIP, delete any remaining files in your "C:\Program Files\Pip" folder and re-install PIP.||||reg||1
Z||000005||count_iblis||11-15-2000||03:14 PM||||i did do that <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/count-sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cliff Pennock||11-15-2000||03:15 PM||||But did you delete any remaining files? It's most likely a corrupted data file. These files are created <B>after</B> installation so they are not deleted by the uninstaller.||||reg||1
